  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving visitor engagement at Laos&#x2019; Premiere Eco-Tourism Site to help combat unsustainable use of nature.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to enhance visitor engagement and wildlife conservation awareness at Tat Kuang Si, Laos&#x2019; top eco-tourism site. It includes upgrading educational materials in three languages, improving accessibility and safety, training tour guides, and distributing brochures. Two new eco-friendly visitor zones will improve bear visibility and welfare. The project supports long-term conservation impact as tourism in the area continues to grow.</narrative>
  </description>
